# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, but these files
# are executed by /bin/sh inside a Linux container. Checked out with CRLF they
# break in ways that are hard to read: the shell reports the interpreter as
# "not found" because it sees "#!/bin/sh\r", and the Dockerfile's backslash
# line continuations stop continuing. Pin them to LF everywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
